From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 21:33:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] 1122 redfin: kernel QMUX router relays PDS (0x06) to
 wland over /dev/sweet-mqrtr, local answers as fallback (kern.sweet_qmux_pds,
 default 0)

---
 bsd/dev/sweet_bb.c   |  23 +++-
 bsd/dev/sweet_bb.h   |   9 ++
 bsd/dev/sweet_qmux.c | 315 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 344 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

